No file picker on a console: the mobile ROM fallback instead

`SelectGameFromUI` opens a desktop file dialog through `portable-file-dialogs`,
which runs zenity or kdialog over pipe/fork/dup2 - none of which this platform
has, and the header does not compile for it. `../ship-of-harkinian/patches/0006`
makes the same call for the same header.

The mobile arm is the one that fits: after the first-run scan of the title's
directory finds nothing, look for `baserom.us.z64` beside the program. There is
no pointer to browse with, and a ROM copied onto the console lands in that
directory anyway.

